}
```
Reason:
The fix introduces checks for the success of memory allocations. If `dma_alloc_attrs()` or `__get_free_pages()` fails, the code now correctly sets the return value and jumps to the appropriate cleanup labels to free any previously allocated resources, preventing memory leaks and use-after-free errors.

